{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE FESTIVAL OF SKILL &amp; SPECTACLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a high-octane universe worshipping speed and destruction, the loudest religion is the arena. Winners are treated like myths while losers are stripped for parts. You step into this mayhem as a \u201cnobody\u201d driver with a dream and a hunger to become the champion of champions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/2facfa426b1d98aa8d8668dd74ebe835.poster.avif?t=1773075456\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/2facfa426b1d98aa8d8668dd74ebe835.webm?t=1773075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/2facfa426b1d98aa8d8668dd74ebe835.mp4?t=1773075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster Punk is a brutal motor-sport tournament where style meets wreckage. Take on unique challenges throughout the competition designed to test your <strong>Monster Punk</strong> driving abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Objectives:</strong> Secure high scores by destroying deadly robots, winning the crowd with stunts, and stealing guarded loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elimination:</strong> Every round uses a unique scoring system where the lowest rated driver is cut from the tournament.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Showdown:</strong> Beat the challenges to face the top contender in a final 1v1 epic battle for the crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/4aa0a92e366c03a47d900820ec5d0e78.poster.avif?t=1773075456\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/4aa0a92e366c03a47d900820ec5d0e78.webm?t=1773075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/4aa0a92e366c03a47d900820ec5d0e78.mp4?t=1773075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Own the ring by mastering the <strong>Monster Punk</strong> truck. Dominating the competition requires high speed precision and perfect shooting drawing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agility:</strong> Jump, boost, and flip to catch massive air time and rack up score multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firepower:</strong> Use heavy guns and brute force to blast through robotic defenders and rival cars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/6c2e6c56115621c850c452a72db2ee4c.poster.avif?t=1773075456\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/6c2e6c56115621c850c452a72db2ee4c.webm?t=1773075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/6c2e6c56115621c850c452a72db2ee4c.mp4?t=1773075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle scores  with shared screen play.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP Showdown:</strong> Head-to-head battles to determine who truly owns the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co op Quickplay:</strong> Team up to master your combat and stunts together in single challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/df008e3658a94756eae3e69550a21262.poster.avif?t=1773075456\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/df008e3658a94756eae3e69550a21262.webm?t=1773075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/df008e3658a94756eae3e69550a21262.mp4?t=1773075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use challenge rewards for mid-round boosts. Win tournaments to buy permanent garage parts and build a machine capable of ruling the Champions League.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506750?t=1773075456","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506750?t=1773075456","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/3952b70b4a887dcf97a72e99f52e3fbe6b762d12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773075456","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/3952b70b4a887dcf97a72e99f52e3fbe6b762d12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773075456","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},