<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Settle scores  with shared screen play.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP Showdown:</strong> Head-to-head battles to determine who truly owns the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co op Quickplay:</strong> Team up to master your combat and stunts together in single challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/df008e3658a94756eae3e69550a21262.poster.avif?t=1773075456\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/df008e3658a94756eae3e69550a21262.webm?t=1773075456\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/extras/df008e3658a94756eae3e69550a21262.mp4?t=1773075456\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use challenge rewards for mid-round boosts. Win tournaments to buy permanent garage parts and build a machine capable of ruling the Champions League.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Fooya Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506750/528cd8b07a63b85e087b76c30fda60324f3d35ee/header.jpg?t=1773075456","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Age Rating & Content Warning:<br />\r\nThis game features animated vehicular and combat violence. Players engage in high-speed heists, vehicular combat, and shootouts against robotic enemies. Expect explosions, crashes, and destruction physics, but no gore or realistic injury. Player discretion is advised for those sensitive to intense act